    "updated_at": "2025-07-02T07:24:31Z",
    "body": "The wpt hints that it was written to match Chromium, not to match any spec.\r\nGecko seems to follow the note in https://w3c.github.io/resource-timing/#dom-performanceresourcetiming-initiatortype\r\nbut I haven't yet found any spec defining properly what the initiatorType actually should be in this case.",
