    "updated_at": "2025-07-02T18:05:14Z",
    "body": "Thank you all for the time and guidance!  Since it's used by IFT, I am closing this PR and will consider adding \"font\" to \"resource timing\" notes. \r\n\r\nI will continue the discussion in the PR to \"resource timing\" notes. In case we end up deciding to rename `font` I will reopen this PR.\r\n\r\nCheers,",
